      "content": "lol \"goblin tax\"?? thats a new one. i've never heard anyone call it that before.\n\nbut seriously, if i just throw everything into a \"miscellaneous\" category, won't that make my books a nightmare to audit later? is there a better way to track those small things that just seem to pop up out of nowhere? like, how do i make sure i'm actually capturing everything without spending five hours a day on data entry?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
