      "content": "okay lol the \"goblin capture spell\" is actually a funny way to think about it. i'll try the photo thing.\n\nbut i'm still a bit worried about the math. if i've already reconciled my bank account for last month, and now i find a few of these \"missing\" small receipts from that same time, how do i add them in? i don't want to mess up the balance that's already been checked. is there a way to just tuck them in there without making the whole thing look like i'm just making numbers up?",
      "source": "evaluator"
